utton><a class=\"nav-item \" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\" data-nav-key=\"settings\" data-tooltip=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\" aria-description=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#settings\"></use></svg><span>个人设置</span></a></section><div class=\"nav-scroll-fade-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></nav>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\">\n      <div class=\"sidebar-bottom-row\"><div class=\"mini-membership\" data-settings-link-ready=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\" title=\"点击打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\">\n        <div class=\"mini-avatar\" data-member-initial=\"\">演</div>\n        <div><span data-member-name=\"\">演示用户</span><small data-member-level=\"\">天使</small></div>\n        <a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\" aria-label=\"打开个人设置\" title=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></a>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"help-button\" href=\"https://wxgaochu.feishu.cn/share/base/webpage/shrcnnUvrmhLammrlrw7Of8QUQf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#help\"></use></svg><span>使用帮助</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  <div class=\"sidebar-resize-handle\" role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" title=\"拖动调整菜单宽度\"></div></aside>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\">\n      <div class=\"topbar-left\">\n        <button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg><b data-nav-mobile-alert=\"\" class=\"nav-alert mobile-menu-alert\" aria-label=\"3 条未读提醒\">3</b></button>\n        <div><span>UNIFIED INBOX</span><div class=\"page-heading-row\"><h1>消息与提醒</h1><p class=\"page-intro\" data-page-note=\"\">看通知，处理客户跟进和笔记复盘提醒。</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>\n        <a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#home\"></use></svg><span>返回经营工作台</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"message-channel-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"message-channel-title\">\n      <div><span>来自不同经营环节的消息，都在这里</span><h2 id=\"message-channel-title\">一个收件箱，看清所有提醒</h2><p>服务通知、经营总结、团队邀请、客户跟进和笔记复盘使用同一套未读规则。标记已读只更新阅读状态，不会删除待办、笔记或经营记录；待跟进和待复盘事项仍需处理。</p></div>\n      <div class=\"message-source-summary\" data-message-source-summary=\"\" aria-label=\"按消息来源筛选\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"message-source-card \" data-source-filter=\"service\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>服务消息</strong><span>3 未读</span><small>运营与会员服务通知 · 共 3 条</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"message-source-card \" data-source-filter=\"digest\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>经营总结</strong><span>无未读</span><small>周总结与月总结 · 共 2 条</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"message-source-card \" data-source-filter=\"invitation\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>团队邀请</strong><span>无未读</span><small>空间邀请与协作关系 · 共 0 条</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"message-source-card \" data-source-filter=\"followup\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>跟进提醒</strong><span>无未读</span><small>客户下一步与到期提醒 · 共 0 条</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"message-source-card \" data-source-filter=\"note\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>笔记复盘</strong><span>无未读</span><small>创业笔记复盘时间提醒 · 共 0 条</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"message-source-card \" data-source-filter=\"winback\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><strong>经营回访</strong><span>无未读</span><small>回来继续推进经营事项 · 共 0 条</small></button></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"content-shell messages-shell\">\n      <div class=\"message-list-panel\">\n        <div class=\"message-panel-head\">\n          <div><span>ALL MESSAGES</span><h2>统一收件箱</h2></div>\n          <strong><span data-unread-count=\"\">3</span> 未读</strong>\n        </div><div class=\"message-tools\"><button type=\"button\" data-message-filter=\"all\" class=\"active\">全部</button><button type=\"button\" data-message-filter=\"unread\" class=\"\">未读</button><button type=\"button\" data-message-filter=\"read\" class=\"\">已读</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"read-all\">全部标为已读</button></div>\n        <div class=\"message-list\" id=\"message-list\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n        <button class=\"load-more\" id=\"message-load-more\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\">加载更多 <svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#arrow\"></use></svg></button>\n        <div class=\"empty-state compact-empty\" id=\"message-empty\">\n          <svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#message\"></use></svg>\n          <h3 data-message-empty-title=\"\">暂无符合条件的消息</h3>\n          <p data-message-empty-copy=\"\">经营回访当前没有符合条件的消息。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n    <article class=\"message-detail-panel\" id=\"message-detail\">\n        <div class=\"detail-label\" data-message-priority=\"\">统一消息</div>\n        <h2 data-message-title=\"\">选择一条消息</h2>\n        <p class=\"detail-summary\" data-message-summary=\"\">点击左侧任意来源的消息，在这里查看详情和下一步。</p>\n        <div class=\"detail-meta\"><span data-message-date=\"\"></span><span data-message-status=\"\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"article-body\" id=\"message-body\"><p>未读状态在所有来源中统一计算。“全部标为已读”只更新阅读状态，不会删除客户待办、团队邀请或经营记录；待跟进和待复盘事项仍需处理。</p></div>\n      </article></section>\n  </main>\n  <div class=\"workspace-toast\" id=\"workspace-toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-restore\" data-sidebar-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\" title=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div class=\"nav-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\"></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog\" data-global-search-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-search=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"global-search-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>GLOBAL SEARCH</span><h2 id=\"global-search-title\">全站搜索</h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-search=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <label class=\"global-search-field\">\n        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#spark\"></use></svg>\n        <input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"搜索你感兴趣的任何内容吧\" aria-label=\"搜索关键词\">\n        <kbd>ESC</kbd>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"global-search-status\">输入关键词，快速找到可以继续使用的内容。</div>\n      <div class=\"global-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog daily-action-dialog\" data-daily-action-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-daily=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel daily-action-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-action-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>DAILY CHECK-IN</span><h2 id=\"daily-action-title\">今日行动 <small class=\"daily-action-brand\">每日出摊</small></h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-daily=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭今日行动\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"daily-action-hint\">辛苦一天不容易，赶紧记一笔，再小的成果也是进步。</p>\n      <form data-daily-action-form=\"\" class=\"daily-action-form\">\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>行动类型 <em class=\"required\">必填</em></legend>\n          <div class=\"daily-action-options\">\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_moments\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了条朋友圈</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"xhs_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇小红书</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_channels_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了视频号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇公众号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_card\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发布了公众号贴图</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"short_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了短视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"long_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了长视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"qa_answer\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>问答平台答了题</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"client_followup\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>聊了老客户</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"self_media_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>自媒体平台发文</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"deal_closed\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>做了个成交</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"private_pool_growth\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>又加了私域</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"scroll_douyin\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>学习了抖音对标博主</span>\n    </label></div>\n        </fieldset>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动标题</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"选填 · 写下今天发出去的内容标题\" data-daily-title=\"\">\n          <small>带标题的记录会展示在 <a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/member-profile.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">你的会员主页</a>，点击可直接跳转查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动网址</span>\n          <input type=\"url\" name=\"url\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"选填 · 其他会员有权限点击查看\" data-daily-url=\"\">\n          <small>其他会员有权限点击查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"daily-action-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"secondary-action\" data-close-daily=\"\">取消</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"meeting-primary\" data-daily-submit=\"\">记一笔今日行动</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-status\" data-daily-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      </form>\n    </section></div><a id=\"bottomBar\" style=\"position: fixed; bottom: -40px; left: 0px; z-index: 9999; transform: translateX(-50%); background-color: transparent; border-radius: 5px 5px 0px 0px; opacity: 0.3; padding: 5px; transition: 0.3s; cursor: pointer; max-height: 100px; max-width: 45px;\"><img src=\"chrome-extension://kobncfkmjelbefaoohoblamnbackjggk/icon/icon_32.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"></a></body><plasmo-csui id=\"aitdk-csui\"></plasmo-csui><div id=\"immersive-translate-popup\" style=\"all: initial\"></div></html>", "controls": [{"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "隐藏菜单", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-sidebar-collapse", ""]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON"